msgid "GaussianFit"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:1
msgid "Regroupe les paramètres de l'ajustement gaussien des localisations."
msgstr "Groups the settings for Gaussian fitting of localizations."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:5
msgid "``Mode`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : paramètres ajustés parmi :math:`X`, :math:`Y`, :math:`\\sigma`, :math:`\\sigma_x`, :math:`\\sigma_y` et :math:`\\theta`."
msgstr "``Mode`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`): parameters fitted among :math:`X`, :math:`Y`, :math:`\\sigma`, :math:`\\sigma_x`, :math:`\\sigma_y`, and :math:`\\theta`."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:7
msgid "``Sigma`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : valeur initiale de :math:`\\sigma` ; valeur par défaut : ``1.0`` pixel."
msgstr "``Sigma`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`): initial value of :math:`\\sigma`; default value: ``1.0`` pixel."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:8
msgid "``Theta`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : valeur initiale de :math:`\\theta` ; valeur par défaut : ``0.0`` degré."
msgstr "``Theta`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`): initial value of :math:`\\theta`; default value: ``0.0`` degree."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:9
msgid "``Z`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : active l'estimation axiale par astigmatisme."
msgstr "``Z`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`): enables axial estimation using astigmatism."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:10
msgid "``Z max`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : valeur absolue maximale utilisée pour initialiser l'estimation axiale ; valeur par défaut : ``500`` nm."
msgstr "``Z max`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`): maximum absolute value used to initialize axial estimation; default value: ``500`` nm."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GaussianFit.GaussianFit:12
msgid "``Model`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BrowseFile.BrowseFile`) : modèle d'astigmatisme spécifique à utiliser."
msgstr "``Model`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BrowseFile.BrowseFile`): specific astigmatism model to use."

